: "https://api.discogs.com/artists/261970"}], "notes": "Red label Rainbo pressing.\nGatefold LP similar to other releases but with a black sticker with Barcode, Daptone Logo and  \"Unlimited Black Vinyl Edition! / Featuring \"This Land is Your Land\" & \"Natural Born Lover / includes MP3 Download Card / DAP 004\"\n\n\"According to the Field Guide To Daptone Records, the first pressing of this album had a gatefold jacket with DAP-003 printed on the spine instead of DAP-004. \nThe 2nd and 3rd pressings still had gatefold sleeves but with DAP-004 on the spine. \nThe 4th pressing was re-mastered with gatefold sleeve with dark blue marketing sticker denoting \"Unlimited gatefold edition\".\n\nThe answer of the label (Daptone - info@daptonerecords.com) about the release date of DAP-004 (via email on on January 3rd, 2025) was: \"The 4th pressing of Natural was roughly 2013.\"\n\nAll songs Boscosound Music, BMI, except 'This Land Is Your Land' Ludlow Music, BMI\n\nRecorded and mixed at Daptone Studios, Bushwick, Brooklyn.\n\nCatering by Daniela Sugarman.\n", "uri": "https://www.discogs.com/release/18890350-Sharon-Jones-And-The-Dap-Kings-Naturally", "master_id": 50156, "genres": ["Funk / Soul"], "styles": ["Soul", "Funk"]}